      "text": "```\nStructure: B subunit (Binding) + A subunit (Active enzymatic moiety)\nB binds host receptor → endocytosis → A subunit translocates into cytoplasm → action"
    },
    {
      "id": "01-BACTERIAL.md#016",
      "path": [
        "01-BACTERIAL.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
