        "title": "Bacterial Disease",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "CHOLERA TOXIN (Vibrio cholerae):\n  A subunit: ADP-ribosylates Gsα (locks Gs in \"always on\" state)\n  → Adenylyl cyclase constitutively active → ↑↑↑ cAMP\n  → PKA → CFTR Cl⁻ channel open → massive Cl⁻ (+ Na⁺, water) secretion into gut lumen\n  → Rice-water diarrhea (up to 20 L/day) → dehydration/death if untreated\n  Mechanism: same as \"activating mutation\" in GPCR pathway"
    },
    {
      "id": "01-BACTERIAL.md#017",
      "path": [
        "01-BACTERIAL.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[mdloom-backfill:disease:01-bacterial, git-history:disease:01-bacterial]",
        "canonical_path": "disease/01-BACTERIAL.md",
        "concepts": "[bacterial]",
        "current_path": "disease/01-BACTERIAL.md",
        "id": "maxim:disease:bacterial",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "disease",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[bacterial]",
        "section": "disease",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Bacterial Disease",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "DIPHTHERIA TOXIN (Corynebacterium diphtheriae):\n  A subunit: ADP-ribosylates EF-2 (elongation factor 2)\n  → Protein synthesis stops → cell death\n  → Pseudomembrane in pharynx + myocarditis + neuropathy"
    },
    {
      "id": "01-BACTERIAL.md#018",
      "path": [
        "01-BACTERIAL.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[mdloom-backfill:disease:01-bacterial, git-history:disease:01-bacterial]",
